# markdown — nothing is tracked by default.
# Four files are unignored on purpose, so a teammate cloning this repo gets the
# rules, the state, and the demo without needing the chat history. Add a fifth
# only if a person needs it to work on this project; never for AI scratch notes.
*.md
!CLAUDE.md
!DEMO.md
!AUDIT.md
!CHANGELOG.md

